Material Design 3 is a design system by Google. The Chinese component and
motion guides summarize Google's guidance. The JSON files reorganize the
published token names, values and aliases by component or theme. The CSS
presets and token sheets use values from the same specifications. The platform
mappings, examples, HCT theme generator and query interface were added by this
project.

